  "title": "Belazreg H NDE 6304",
  "date": "02.07.2007",
  "content": "I found myself floating in a universe of nothingness. I was wearing clothes and I felt full of love, a love I cannot describe in words. In my mind, there was no past and no future. I felt very well indeed! I could sense that there was someone, or some kind of being, behind me. This being turned me around without passing in front of me. I began to see myself through her eyes. I felt like she was communicating with me, and the message was, 'You are naive!' This is where the experience ended. I don't remember coming back. I needed a year and a half in order to understand that the being behind me did not want to harm me. After all, it was she through whom I had seen myself.",
